WEBVTT

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:37.670
Is he awakening again?

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:46.610
Dad?

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:56.520
<i>Can I keep on praying?</i>

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:59.920
<i>Can I keep on believing?</i>

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:06.760
<i>Oh light that shines</i> <i>in the forest of despair</i>

00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:23.280
<i>I kick the cold ground with my toes</i>

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:30.390
<i>My brushed hair</i> <i>dances in the moonlit night</i>

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:36.960
<i>Let's throw away your</i> <i>frightened eyes and loneliness</i>

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:44.730
<i>Those days when acting tough</i> <i>was your only friend...</i>

00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:49.410
<i>Leave that in the distance</i>

00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:53.240
<i>Is my salvation over there?</i>

00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:56.580
<i>Can I heal this deep darkness?</i>

00:01:56.580 --> 00:02:02.320
<i>Is it okay for me to seek warmth?</i>

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:06.620
<i>I want to be stronger</i> <i>than anyone else</i>

00:02:06.620 --> 00:02:09.860
<i>I want to protect my loved ones</i>

00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:16.030
<i>Oh light that continues</i> <i>to shine on me</i>

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:21.970
Kappa and Dad!

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:28.840
Hey, Maiko. I'm Keita Kawahira.

00:02:29.150 --> 00:02:32.380
Huh? You don't remember?
Oh, come on.

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:35.850
Yeah, with the dog leash.

00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:37.590
It's Keita Kawahira.

00:02:38.620 --> 00:02:39.520
Teleport.

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:45.130
I did it.

00:02:45.130 --> 00:02:47.730
Keita, lunch is almost ready.

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:50.000
- Keita.
- That was fun.

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:51.970
Next time?

00:02:52.740 --> 00:02:54.000
Sounds good.

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:55.840
Go away.

00:02:56.170 --> 00:02:59.740
Oh sorry, I have a disobedient dog.

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:01.180
So by the way...

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:05.680
Don't worry about it.
It always happens.

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:07.680
I'm not going to let go.

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:13.560
Actually, I just lost my home, so I want to live there...

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:15.260
With my dog.

00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:19.500
Hello?

00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:21.500
Don't cheat on me.

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:24.970
Cut it out!

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:31.570
If you didn't interrupt, we could've escaped from this miserable life!

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:34.640
It was going pretty well this time.

00:03:35.740 --> 00:03:37.350
My last contact...

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:39.280
Living here is fine.

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:41.380
I don't want to!

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:43.320
Mosquitos at night.

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:46.490
And the cicadas keep hammering in the morning.

00:03:47.390 --> 00:03:51.030
I've had enough of this lifestyle.

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:54.960
I'm hungry.

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:57.570
Thanks for the food.

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:59.270
You're welcome.

00:04:00.270 --> 00:04:02.400
- Calmed down?
- Yeah.

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:08.540
Yoko.

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:09.650
What?

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:12.750
You sure are energetic.

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:13.880
Really?

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:19.320
Nothing but bad news after we dealt with him.

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:21.590
Our home was destroyed.

00:04:22.020 --> 00:04:24.090
We lost our savings.

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:26.560
Power of negativity?

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:30.000
Because you defeated the Reaper possessing the Sindo family,

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.870
it seems that you're struck with a calamity.

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:34.700
What the heck?

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:37.510
Well, I think it's only temporary...

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:39.610
Karina?

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:43.110
Sorry, looks like I strained my back.

00:04:43.810 --> 00:04:48.420
Looks like anyone who's involved with you will get unlucky.

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:52.020
No way.

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:53.860
So no jobs either.

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:56.860
I'm cut off from my lifelines.

00:04:56.860 --> 00:04:59.530
But it's only temporary, right?

00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:00.830
I hope so.

00:05:01.060 --> 00:05:04.430
Like passing rain, the sun will rise soon.

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:07.340
You never change.

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:09.240
Really?

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:11.210
I'm going out.

00:05:11.610 --> 00:05:12.640
Where?

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:14.710
It's a secret.

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:16.210
Okay then.

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:17.210
Hiring part-timers

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:20.180
I was too late.

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:23.990
Out of business...

00:05:25.820 --> 00:05:26.990
I'm hired?

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:28.490
Yes, yes.

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:31.730
It's so cute.

00:05:31.730 --> 00:05:33.430
It really fits you.

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:36.770
Try saying, "Welcome home, Master."

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:37.870
Why?

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:39.970
Just hurry up and do it.

00:05:39.970 --> 00:05:41.600
Oh, okay then.

00:05:42.910 --> 00:05:45.310
Welcome home, Master.

00:05:45.310 --> 00:05:47.280
How sweet!
How sweet!

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:49.580
The sweetness is here.

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:53.250
Um, what do we do here?

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:57.120
You came without knowing?

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.290
Yeah.

00:05:58.690 --> 00:06:02.090
This place is for, you know...

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:06.260
And then... Touch...

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:07.300
And that kind of stuff.

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:08.530
Cosplay Sweetness House

00:06:08.530 --> 00:06:09.630
I' m sorry!

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:11.000
Wait!

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:13.840
You can be our top employee.

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:19.510
And I thought I finally landed a job.

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:22.910
Is this also because of that bad luck thing?

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:25.650
At this rate...

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:37.130
Keita.

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:39.030
You never change, do you?

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:42.970
I did.

00:06:43.530 --> 00:06:49.470
I thought it would be easy to tell you about my true form when we first met.

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:53.080
When the time came,
I was ready to explain.

00:06:53.340 --> 00:06:57.980
But the more fun memories
I have with you...

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:01.420
I...

00:07:05.620 --> 00:07:06.990
Hake?

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:11.160
Red fox, green raccoon.

00:07:11.460 --> 00:07:14.560
Golden fox, huh?

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:19.000
Red, green, and gold.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:21.240
Green Kappa monster.

00:07:23.470 --> 00:07:24.670
What the heck is that?

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:30.480
Repay me for this one day.

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:33.980
I said one day, but now is fine too.

00:07:36.690 --> 00:07:37.950
Here you go.

00:07:40.190 --> 00:07:41.960
Master Keita.

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:46.660
Grandma is so cruel.

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:49.970
She gave me the work, but ignores me when I need help.

00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:53.700
I told her to call you, Master Keita.

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:55.340
Thank you, Tomohane.

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:56.710
So at the very least,

00:07:57.070 --> 00:07:59.710
here's some food and other things.

00:08:02.980 --> 00:08:04.710
You're amazing, Nadeshiko.

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:06.820
We got some fireworks too.

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:09.920
Umm, where is Yoko?

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:12.650
- She's out right now.
- Is that so?

00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:14.520
You have business with Yoko?

00:08:14.520 --> 00:08:15.860
No.

00:08:16.190 --> 00:08:18.530
Maybe we missed her on the way?

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:22.660
I hope that's the case.
It would be great to have her here.

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:25.870
Oh no, nothing.

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:35.080
It's so pretty.

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:41.950
Why not at least let
Keita stay at your place?

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:45.190
I wished for the same thing too, but...

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:46.320
But?

00:08:46.320 --> 00:08:50.690
The family head said that the bad luck would spread.

00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:58.300
Hake.

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:00.700
So what's your business?

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:03.040
You're not just here to play around, right?

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:04.710
You saw through me.

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:07.880
Then let me get straight to the point.

00:09:08.780 --> 00:09:11.750
Dai Yoko is awakening.

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:19.820
He manipulates shadows, and wields petrification, fire, and teleportation.

00:09:19.820 --> 00:09:22.390
Shakes the world as it leaps.

00:09:22.390 --> 00:09:26.800
A great monster that can do anything with his breath.

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:29.360
Strong and arrogant.

00:09:29.360 --> 00:09:33.340
If he's irritated, he could erase an entire mountain.

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:34.700
He is like a kid.

00:09:34.700 --> 00:09:37.470
No, it's worse since he's an adult.

00:09:38.270 --> 00:09:42.510
Until now, the power of the Kawahira family had somehow sealed him.

00:09:43.110 --> 00:09:48.020
But due to his raging spirit, the seal is starting to break apart.

00:09:53.660 --> 00:09:55.060
Dad is...

00:09:58.330 --> 00:09:59.560
Dad!

00:09:59.560 --> 00:10:04.170
What are you doing, my daughter?

00:10:06.100 --> 00:10:12.810
"Inukami!"

00:10:13.640 --> 00:10:15.080
Woof woof.

00:10:18.350 --> 00:10:19.580
Dad!

00:10:19.580 --> 00:10:24.320
What are you doing, my daughter?

00:10:24.320 --> 00:10:25.090
That's right.

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:30.190
With my own hand, I...

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:32.790
While it may be temporary,

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:37.870
right now we're reinforcing the seal with an animal barrier.

00:10:44.070 --> 00:10:45.570
You want me.

00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:49.950
You want me, Yoko.

00:10:49.950 --> 00:10:51.310
Yes.

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:55.520
But, you have the right to decline.

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:58.290
Although that is just my sentiment.

00:10:58.650 --> 00:11:01.860
To ask a daughter to seal her father twice.

00:11:01.860 --> 00:11:05.160
For you, it must be hard to ask that.

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:17.240
Yoko.

00:11:17.670 --> 00:11:18.910
I'm sorry.

00:11:20.680 --> 00:11:22.410
I mean...

00:11:32.320 --> 00:11:34.320
Now then.

00:11:41.560 --> 00:11:44.430
I never thought Dad would push me.

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:50.640
I'll talk with Dad.

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:54.880
But before that,
I have to tell Keita about myself.

00:11:55.580 --> 00:11:56.950
Properly.

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:02.450
- Keita?
- Hey.

00:12:06.720 --> 00:12:08.720
Do you remember this place?

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:12.730
Yeah. It's the place where
I made my contract with you.

00:12:13.060 --> 00:12:15.730
The place where we made our contract.

00:12:16.360 --> 00:12:21.840
Gosh, I would've won if there weren't some weirdo around.

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:23.570
You're making excuses.

00:12:23.570 --> 00:12:24.940
I'm not.

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:27.980
You were trembling because of a puppy.

00:12:27.980 --> 00:12:31.010
"I'll listen to you, so take this dog away."

00:12:31.010 --> 00:12:33.220
I can still picture how you cried.

00:12:34.550 --> 00:12:37.690
But still, for an
Inukami to hate dogs.

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:39.960
It really is weird.

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:43.160
It's because I'm not an Inukami.

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:46.230
I'm...

00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:50.430
I'm...

00:12:52.400 --> 00:12:54.770
I'm the enemy of the Kawahira family.

00:12:55.440 --> 00:12:57.170
And the enemy of Inukami.

00:12:57.870 --> 00:13:02.440
I'm the daughter of the sealed great fox monster, Dai Yoko.

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:08.480
You thought I was an Inukami and made a contract.

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:14.120
I'm sorry for lying all this time.

00:13:14.720 --> 00:13:16.260
Dai Yoko, huh?

00:13:17.460 --> 00:13:19.430
I've heard from Grandma.

00:13:19.960 --> 00:13:22.900
So you're his daughter?
That's awesome.

00:13:23.670 --> 00:13:25.400
Keita? Are you listening?

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:29.340
Yeah. Well, who cares?

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:32.770
Whether you're a dog or a fox,

00:13:32.770 --> 00:13:35.380
I still made a contract with Yoko.

00:13:35.940 --> 00:13:40.020
So if you had no intention of telling me, then I won't ask.

00:13:40.350 --> 00:13:44.150
But, I wondered if you were worried about that.

00:13:44.390 --> 00:13:46.660
So I came to check up on you.

00:13:48.860 --> 00:13:53.060
I told you, "You never change," right?

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:56.160
Truth is, I'm the same. So...

00:13:56.700 --> 00:14:00.600
From now on, our relationship won't change either.

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:04.170
Actually, let's make another contract.

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:06.370
Here, contract fee.

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:12.010
Keita. This is unlike you.

00:14:13.180 --> 00:14:14.680
I think so too.

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:29.600
What's wrong?

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:36.710
I'll be going.

00:14:38.070 --> 00:14:39.270
Okay then.

00:14:40.380 --> 00:14:42.210
- I'm off.
- See you.

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:56.460
Come, let's dance.

00:14:56.460 --> 00:14:59.730
Let's sing, meow meow.

00:14:59.730 --> 00:15:05.730
Tonight, we the cats,

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:13.070
surround the locked cage.

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:16.750
Let's dance and build a dam.

00:15:17.250 --> 00:15:20.750
In the name of the traveling cat, Tomekichi.

00:15:21.020 --> 00:15:22.520
In his name!

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:25.420
Reinforce seal!

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:30.990
Darn you.

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:35.930
You foolish cats.

00:15:40.340 --> 00:15:42.500
Did we do it?

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:44.740
We did it.

00:15:46.510 --> 00:15:50.250
Well done. Truly well done.

00:15:50.580 --> 00:15:52.110
Thank you very much.

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:02.560
It's not over yet.

00:16:03.360 --> 00:16:06.630
This kind of seal is useless.

00:16:13.340 --> 00:16:14.440
I knew it.

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:17.210
It wouldn't be so easy.

00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:22.710
Soon, I will be released.

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:27.550
Just like that time.

00:16:27.950 --> 00:16:29.420
We need Yoko's power.

00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:39.660
That female fox.

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:43.400
She's here. The enemy of us Inukami.

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:46.400
- Yoko.
- Miss Yoko.

00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:50.340
So you've come.

00:16:50.340 --> 00:16:51.540
Yoko.

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:53.110
We've been waiting.

00:16:54.940 --> 00:16:57.650
Yoko, huh?

00:16:58.950 --> 00:16:59.880
Dad.

00:17:00.250 --> 00:17:05.490
How nostalgic. It has been 300 years since you came here, hasn't it?

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:08.890
You've become such a beauty.

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:11.230
I'm sorry about that time.

00:17:11.230 --> 00:17:13.730
I won't do bad things anymore.

00:17:13.730 --> 00:17:17.430
Now, let me out of here, Yoko.

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:21.400
Let me see your face closer.

00:17:21.870 --> 00:17:24.640
Dad, I'm sorry.

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:26.910
What did you say?

00:17:31.410 --> 00:17:34.720
Dad, I'm doing fine.

00:17:35.520 --> 00:17:38.250
I met Keita and learned about fun.

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:42.460
When I'm with Keita,
I'm laughing from my heart.

00:17:42.990 --> 00:17:45.730
When I'm with Keita, every day is fun.

00:17:46.360 --> 00:17:50.930
Even without anything else, as long as
I'm with Keita, I'm having fun.

00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:54.470
I want to have more fun with Keita.

00:17:54.470 --> 00:17:56.470
Keita, you say?

00:17:57.270 --> 00:18:00.710
In the name of Yoko, daughter of Dai Yoko.

00:18:01.480 --> 00:18:03.480
Yoko, what are you doing?

00:18:03.480 --> 00:18:05.880
Make the seal persist longer!

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:45.650
What? I won't allow that!

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:49.660
I won't allow that, Yoko.
Anything but that!

00:18:50.020 --> 00:18:56.030
To love a human,
Daddy definitely won't allow that!

00:19:08.210 --> 00:19:10.980
Dad, I'm sorry.

00:19:12.510 --> 00:19:13.650
Yoko.

00:19:14.950 --> 00:19:16.890
We're saved.

00:19:16.890 --> 00:19:18.250
Well done.

00:19:18.250 --> 00:19:20.760
Truly well done.

00:19:34.100 --> 00:19:37.840
Hey. You too, applause.

00:19:43.580 --> 00:19:45.210
Geez.

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:50.620
As the head of the Inukami,
I apologize for the clan's rudeness.

00:19:57.460 --> 00:19:59.390
Blech.

00:20:04.100 --> 00:20:07.300
Yoko.

00:20:07.300 --> 00:20:10.940
Go, to your master's side.

00:20:22.150 --> 00:20:24.490
Hake, thank you for your efforts.

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:28.820
Great job performing such a difficult task.

00:20:28.820 --> 00:20:30.390
No.

00:20:30.630 --> 00:20:33.030
I didn't do anything.

00:20:33.660 --> 00:20:36.900
Yoko changed on her own accord.

00:20:37.370 --> 00:20:39.870
Ever since she met Master Keita.

00:20:52.410 --> 00:20:53.650
Kappa!

00:20:53.920 --> 00:20:55.680
Help out too, will you?

00:20:56.550 --> 00:20:57.890
Keita.

00:21:00.890 --> 00:21:02.360
Hey, welcome home.

00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:05.360
I'm back.

00:21:05.730 --> 00:21:07.860
You want to eat breakfast?

00:21:07.860 --> 00:21:09.100
Yeah.

00:21:11.670 --> 00:21:13.070
Keita.

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:17.340
Whoa. Hey.

00:21:17.340 --> 00:21:19.110
Keita.

00:21:19.510 --> 00:21:21.340
I love you.

00:21:37.860 --> 00:21:43.130
<i>This and that, we want everything</i>

00:21:43.130 --> 00:21:48.540
<i>We wish for love and that all</i> <i>of our dreams will come true</i>

00:21:48.540 --> 00:21:53.680
<i>Every girl is busy</i>

00:21:53.680 --> 00:21:58.880
<i>Playing, studying, going crazy</i>
<i>Our schedules are filled</i>

00:21:59.480 --> 00:22:02.020
<i>When we are about to be dumped,</i>

00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:04.450
<i>we send texts and gather</i>

00:22:04.690 --> 00:22:07.260
<i>A meeting at a family restaurant,</i>

00:22:07.260 --> 00:22:10.830
<i>and nothing makes any sense.</i>

00:22:11.160 --> 00:22:13.730
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:13.730 --> 00:22:16.430
<i>We eat some sweets while we chat</i>

00:22:16.430 --> 00:22:21.670
<i>We can't stop, and now</i> <i>our diets are doomed too</i>

00:22:21.670 --> 00:22:24.110
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:24.110 --> 00:22:26.810
<i>When we go crazy together,</i>

00:22:26.810 --> 00:22:32.910
<i>we get so excited that we can</i> <i>forget our sadness a bit</i>

00:22:33.350 --> 00:22:35.720
<i>Let's go. Let's go. Fight</i>

00:22:35.720 --> 00:22:38.390
<i>Our hearts are one,</i>

00:22:38.390 --> 00:22:42.020
<i>tied by a strong bond</i> <i>called friendship</i>

00:22:50.400 --> 00:22:54.100
Inukami!

00:22:54.100 --> 00:22:55.040
See you!

00:22:56.140 --> 00:22:59.870
Once upon a time, an elderly couple saved a crane.

00:23:00.140 --> 00:23:03.540
A while later, a lovely little girl visited them.

00:23:03.810 --> 00:23:07.880
"While I'm weaving, make sure you don't peek."

00:23:08.280 --> 00:23:10.920
But, the two peeked.

00:23:10.920 --> 00:23:13.250
"You broke the promise.
You're awful."

00:23:13.250 --> 00:23:17.090
And then the little girl turned into a crane and flew off.

00:23:17.090 --> 00:23:18.890
Next on Inukami!

00:23:18.890 --> 00:23:21.130
"Returning a Favor to an Aroused Keita!"

00:23:21.130 --> 00:23:25.070
Basically, it means peeking is bad.
